@page "/datagrid"
@** The DataGrid's examples (design-extended-library.md §2.1): the ones every grid needs first,
    then what the extended layer adds — the built-in filter and the density (2026-10-16), later
    the aggregates, resize, editing, grouping and export as their examples arrive. *@
@import { Typography, Paginator } from "@tsazor/bootstrap"
@import Example from "../Example.tsazor"
@import GridBasicExample from "../examples/grid/grid-basic.tsazor"
@import GridSortingExample from "../examples/grid/grid-sorting.tsazor"
@import GridPaginationExample from "../examples/grid/grid-pagination.tsazor"
@import GridSelectionExample from "../examples/grid/grid-selection.tsazor"
@import GridFilterExample from "../examples/grid/grid-filter.tsazor"
@import GridDensityExample from "../examples/grid/grid-density.tsazor"
@import GridAggregatesExample from "../examples/grid/grid-aggregates.tsazor"
@import GridWidthsExample from "../examples/grid/grid-widths.tsazor"
@import GridEditingExample from "../examples/grid/grid-editing.tsazor"

<Typography Variant="h1">DataGrid</Typography>
<Typography>
    A grid shaped like Blazor's QuickGrid: the columns are PropertyColumn and TemplateColumn
    children, the rows come from Items (sorted and paged here) or an ItemsProvider (sorted and
    paged by your code or a server, with an AbortSignal). The extended layer's features — the
    built-in column filter among them — are QuickGrid-shaped extensions.
</Typography>

<Example Title="A grid over rows" Description="The columns from PropertyColumn and TemplateColumn, the data as Items."
    Id="grid/grid-basic"><GridBasicExample /></Example>

<Example Title="Sorting" Description="Sortable columns sort on a click on their header; the default sort applies without one."
    Id="grid/grid-sorting"><GridSortingExample /></Example>

<Example Title="Pagination" Description="A shared PaginationState drives the grid and the Paginator."
    Id="grid/grid-pagination"><GridPaginationExample /></Example>

<Example Title="Selection" Description="Checkboxes bound to selectedItems; radio buttons for one row."
    Id="grid/grid-selection"><GridSelectionExample /></Example>

<Example Title="The built-in filter" Description="A filterable column gets a filter in its options panel: operator, value, apply and clear."
    Id="grid/grid-filter"><GridFilterExample /></Example>

<Example Title="Density" Description="density compact is the dense table; comfortable is the normal one."
    Id="grid/grid-density"><GridDensityExample /></Example>

<Example Title="Aggregates" Description="A footer per column: sum, avg, count, min, max or your own, over all rows or the current page's."
    Id="grid/grid-aggregates"><GridAggregatesExample /></Example>

<Example Title="Column width and order" Description="The header's grip moves a column (drag or arrow keys); the handle at its end resizes it."
    Id="grid/grid-widths"><GridWidthsExample /></Example>

<Example Title="Inline editing" Description="Editing a row: its columns with an EditContent show the edit cells; Enter commits, Escape cancels."
    Id="grid/grid-editing"><GridEditingExample /></Example>